{# The question field and its button. Shared by the front door and the
   conversation, so the two never drift apart. The only difference is the
   label, which changes once a conversation has started.

   The privacy hint shows on the front door only. Pass questionHint as false to
   leave it off: once someone is in a conversation it read as nagging, and the
   ask page already carried it when they started.

   The GOV.UK character count carries the limit rather than a maxlength
   attribute. maxlength silently truncates pasted text, so someone would send a
   question with the end cut off and never know. The threshold keeps the count
   out of the way until the question is nearly too long. Without JavaScript the
   limit shows as a static line and the server still rejects anything over it
   with a specific error. #}
{% set hint = questionHint if questionHint is defined else "Do not include personal or sensitive information" %}
<form method="post" action="{{ paths.ask }}" class="{{ questionFormClass | default('app-ask__panel') }}">
  <div class="govuk-character-count"
    data-module="govuk-character-count"
    data-maxlength="{{ maxQuestionLength }}"
    data-threshold="{{ questionCountThreshold }}">
    <div class="govuk-form-group{% if error %} govuk-form-group--error{% endif %}">
      <label class="govuk-label {{ questionLabelClass | default('govuk-label--m') }}" for="question">
        {{ questionLabel | default('Your question') }}
      </label>
      {% if hint %}
      <div id="question-hint" class="govuk-hint">{{ hint }}</div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if error %}
      <p id="question-error" class="govuk-error-message">
        <span class="govuk-visually-hidden">Error:</span> {{ error }}
      </p>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="app-ask__field">
        <textarea
          class="govuk-textarea govuk-js-character-count app-ask__input{% if error %} govuk-textarea--error{% endif %}"
          id="question"
          name="question"
          rows="{{ questionRows }}"
          enterkeyhint="send"
          data-module="app-ask-question"
          aria-describedby="question-info{% if hint %} question-hint{% endif %}{% if error %} question-error{% endif %}">{{ question or '' }}</textarea>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="govuk-button app-ask__send" data-module="govuk-button">
        Ask<span class="govuk-visually-hidden"> the toolkit</span>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div id="question-info" class="govuk-hint govuk-character-count__message">
      You can enter up to {{ maxQuestionLength }} characters
    </div>
  </div>
</form>
